sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as Operator / Pod Scheduler
    participant Init as Init Container<br/>(init_managed_pipelines)
    participant Volume as Shared Volume<br/>(/config/managed-pipelines)
    participant KFPAPI as KFP API Server
    participant Step as Pipeline Step Container<br/>(@dsl.component)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant Ray as Ray Cluster<br/>(CodeFlare SDK)
    participant KServe as KServe Runtime

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Operator,KFPAPI: Init Container Flow (Pod Startup)
        Operator->>Init: Start init container
        Init->>Init: Check RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars
        alt RELATED_IMAGE_* set (operator-managed)
            Init->>Init: Recompile pipelines with<br/>substituted image references
        end
        Init->>Volume: Copy pre-compiled pipeline YAMLs<br/>to /config/managed-pipelines
        Volume-->>KFPAPI: Mount shared volume
        KFPAPI->>Volume: Read pipeline YAMLs
        KFPAPI->>KFPAPI: Register managed pipelines
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over KFPAPI,KServe: Pipeline Execution Flow
        KFPAPI->>Step: Launch data processing step
        Step->>S3: Fetch dataset (boto3)<br/>Auth: AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
        S3-->>Step: Dataset artifacts
        Step->>HF: Download model/data<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Step: Model artifacts

        opt Distributed Processing (parse-and-chunk)
            Step->>K8sAPI: load_incluster_config()<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            K8sAPI-->>Step: Cluster config
            Step->>Ray: Submit RayJob<br/>(CodeFlare SDK)
            Ray-->>Step: Processed documents
        end

        Note over Step: Write intermediate artifacts<br/>to PVC-backed workspace

        KFPAPI->>Step: Launch training step
        Note over Step: Read artifacts from workspace PVC
        Step->>Step: Train model<br/>(InstructLab / AutoGluon)
        Note over Step: Write model artifacts to PVC

        KFPAPI->>Step: Launch evaluation step
        Step->>KServe: Evaluate via Eval Hub<br/>KServe inference
        KServe-->>Step: Evaluation results

        KFPAPI->>Step: Launch deployment step
        Step->>K8sAPI: Register model in<br/>Kubeflow Model Registry<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Step: Registration confirmed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Step,K8sAPI: Credential Flow
        Note over Step: Credentials injected as env vars:<br/>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY / S3_SECRET_KEY<br/>HF_TOKEN / LLM_API_KEY<br/>KUBERNETES_AUTH_TOKEN
        Step->>K8sAPI: In-cluster access via<br/>load_incluster_config()<br/>ServiceAccount token
    end
